    "Turn on High Dynamic Range for this display in Displays settings to use extra brightness. This changes how everyday content looks on some displays. You can turn it off again at any time." : {
      "comment" : "Verdict: an HDR display with HDR off; “High Dynamic Range” and “Displays” are macOS’s own names",
